              "content": "Asynchronously validate an SMTP channel (this endpoint is irrelevant to other channel types). When you create an SMTP channel via the API, [create a channel](https://dev.frontapp.com/reference/post_inboxes-inbox-id-channels) with type smtp and the send_as set to the needed email address. You then [configure the email provider](https://help.front.com/en/articles/2081), after which you use this endpoint to asynchronously validate the SMTP settings.\n\nRequired scope: `channels:write`",
